AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35204> "A role played by a foreign substance mixed with or attached to a given substance to enable the distribution or location of the latter to be determined subsequently.")
